add('W02','Water','Whale Gulper 320 BP2054, 24 VDC diaphragm pump',1,'each',204.19,'https://www.neobits.com/whale_bp2054_gulper_320_24v_retail_each__p24302101.html','Exact 24 V part BP2054, not 12 V BP2052. Seller page/index lists in stock and $204.19; live stock and delivered price require checkout. 3/4- or 1-inch connection; clarified-water candidate only. Marine/bilge service is not evidence of abrasive plasma-fines compatibility. Keep intake above sludge and provide accessible protection approved by pump maker.',evidence='indexed_seller_price_checkout_unverified')
