add('W03','Water','Custom vented reservoir with baffle and accessible cleanout',1,'assembly',url='https://www.tank-mart.com/fabricated-tanks/',notes='Rev C internal clear size 900 x 500 x 350 mm =157.5 L gross. Required usable return capacity >=125 L. Proposed total system charge <=110 L. Quote HDPE/PP or compatible coated/welded steel with full floor support, baffle, pickup, common headspace, ports and removable cleaning cover. Wall thickness, fittings, reinforcement and lid add to external envelope; internal dimensions are not a procurement envelope. Request custom quote; no inquiry sent.')
