add('W04','Water','Pan level switches: low / normal / independent high-high',3,'channel',url='https://www.fluidswitch.com/product/horizontal-level-detector-stainless-steel/',notes='Exact float model and brackets require drawing. Pan floor 735-747, normal water 815, overflow 825 mm; switches need mounting/hysteresis separation. Use protected, removable, cleanable sensing pockets away from slag. Do not assume three generic long float stems fit the 100 mm pan. Low-level proves drain condition only at its actual sensor point.')
